      "writtenOn": "2025-08-14T17:46:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could a separate vendor driver interface provide the same functionality here(translating a dma-buf FD to a restricted handle)?  Is there more context on why this needs to be done in the dma-buf heap interface?",
      "parentUuid": "42c256b7_dfc50eda",
      "revId": "1952cbeb1f61da8e5db3cff544dd35402ad4c57c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e9a38934_f9da5caf",
        "filename": "include/uapi/linux/dma-heap.h",
